## Induction Heating sample: straight cylindrical conductor
## Required labels: source, sink (sidesets on end faces)
## Optional labels: workpiece, air
##
## Simple cylinder with source/sink on the two end faces.
## Passes p-convergence test (single curved surface, no torus issues).
##
## Usage: Solve -> Radia-NGSolve -> Induction Heating

reset

# Cylindrical conductor (radius 0.01 m, length 0.1 m)
create cylinder height 0.1 radius 0.01

# Mesh
volume 1 scheme tetmesh
volume 1 size auto factor 5
mesh volume 1

# Material block
block 1 add volume 1
block 1 name "coil"

# Terminal faces (top and bottom of cylinder)
sideset 1 add surface 2
sideset 1 name "source"
sideset 2 add surface 3
sideset 2 name "sink"
